{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_st03","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":19,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-ST-3","storyName":"复航","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"塞雷娅用已经完成的“树”为筹码与官方展开谈判，在保下“螺旋桨天堂”的同时，为莱茵解除了自特里蒙事件以来被政府隐隐施加的科研限制。莱茵众人久违地重聚，汇总各自的发现，为下个时代制定新的科研计划。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_st03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_st03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"characters":["塞雷娅","杰克逊","费尔南","雅斯彭","高登","科学顾问？","娜斯提","梅希亚","斯凯","莱茵研究员","？？？","缪尔赛思","斐尔迪南","马里亚姆","小贾斯汀"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_bg_38_g1_rhinemeetingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$Tremont_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act25side/m_avg_tremont_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":10},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_vertical_common","size":"290,760","style":"0","offset":"200,0","channel":"3","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":11},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":12},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"false","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":14},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"精彩的演讲，副总统先生。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"甚至在莱茵的休息室，我都能听见哭声。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"我倒是没想过自己能打动哥伦比亚最特立独行的科研工作者们。","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"不过，花束、横幅、言辞激烈的支持信、涂装成我的模样的士兵模型……这几个小时里我已经收到够多了。","id":22},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"莱茵没送。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#6$1","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"……哈哈，挺好。那就言归正传吧，塞雷娅总辖。","id":28},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#7$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"从科学的角度，我们该怎么定性那棵飘在天上的“树”？","id":30},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"如果您真的在意它的科学原理，我不介意花整个下午向您解释它如何将根系扎进整片大地，让枝叶蔓及整片天空。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"但我想，从科学的角度，您只需要知道它的完全形态可以汇集哥伦比亚全境的能量与信息，再进行集中处理。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#3$1","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"你是说，一座生效范围广及整个哥伦比亚的……能量井？","id":37},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"以及服务器，而且是双向运行。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"不仅从大地向天空汇集，也可以反向地从天空向大地输送——既有根系，也有枝叶。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"哈哈。","id":44},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"就别勉强自己理解这些了，副总统阁下。您当初在特里蒙访问莱茵的时候是怎么走神的，现在也还是。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"国防部的几十架城防炮，与梅兰德所控媒体的数百颗镜头一齐对准那棵“树”的时候，是您开口把它保了下来。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"雅拉女士的一番话确实感人肺腑，哪怕我这样的老家伙，也难免想起了些年轻时候的不羁。","id":51},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"原来如此。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"我还以为您是不想把给这棵“树”定性的机会，白白让给国防部或梅兰德呢。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#5$1","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"……","id":58},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"一次展会、一场演讲，飞天狂热、爱国情怀，在几个小时之内为您换来了遥遥领先于其他候选人的支持率。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"但下一场演讲，您需要描绘一个怎样的未来，才能回应得了那些支持，您现在想清楚了吗？","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"还是说，您本来就计划对着这棵“树”看图说话？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"你知道国防部当初和克丽斯腾达成的共识。克丽斯腾造好“弧光一号”，国防部用它炸谁，与莱茵无关。","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"“树”的定性权已经在我手里。我在想，如果我给它定性的时候没找莱茵商量，它不会当场冲破星荚吧？","id":67},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"您当然可以不找任何人商量，不论是娜斯提和我、将军和议员们，还是您肩上的那只玩偶。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"……哈哈。","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"我突然想收回之前和秘书闲聊时对你的评价。","id":74},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#6$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"什么？","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"你比克丽斯腾更好打交道。","id":80},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#5$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"……","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"说说你的要求吧。","id":86},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"解除对“螺旋桨天堂”的封锁，让那个逃亡的地块回到特区的航道上休整，至于一干人等的追责……","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#3$1","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"“逃亡”？特区政府不会这么定性刚刚发生的事情。","id":92},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"面对别国的蓄意破坏，哥伦比亚最前沿的科研人员最不可能选择的就是懦弱的“逃亡”，对吧？","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"还有呢？","id":95},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_896_1#1$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"解除对莱茵生命的封锁……您知道我在说什么。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"r","switch":"true","pfrom":"190,0","pto":"190,0","name":"avg_npc_897_1#1$1","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"尽快为你我安排一场正式的会议吧，塞雷娅总辖。你不能要求哥伦比亚去做并不存在的事情。我们向来只是好奇……","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"杰克逊","text":"未来的莱茵生命能做到什么。","id":102},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":103},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"charslot","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","id":108},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_68_g2_groundparkstreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"今晚还真是没有一个人睡觉……早知道我就提前组织夜间荒野探险自由行了。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"哈哈，地块抛锚了你都安分不下来。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你不也一样？你现在的表情，简直像复工第一天惆怅地盯着写字楼外面天空的小职员。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"唉，其实……跟梅兰德的人打起来的时候，我虽然怕得要死，但也真的很激动。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你差点把那个特工头子的手指头咬下来，我都吓到了。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"我不是个情绪化的人。上一次这么激动，还是在刚借到那笔以天空为名的高利贷的时候。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"放贷人在我们镇的酒馆门口展示他所有那些稀奇古怪的浮空设备，围观的人把酒馆的栏杆都挤塌了。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"最后决定谁是那个能拿到贷款的“幸运儿”的，不是学历，不是经济条件，而是谁能把一架小型无人机飞得最高、最远。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"结果你成了那个被骗进去的倒霉蛋嘛，你告诉过我。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"那天晚上，我像个傻子似的向妻子炫耀着我用来操控摇杆的那根手指——就是它为我们赢得了踏入未来的机会……","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"直到几天之后你才知道那个遥控器根本没装电池？","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"是啊，头脑发热的时候，我就不该相信自己的判断。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"可今天你跟我们一起往封锁线上冲的时候，没想那么多吧？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"嗯。结果，现在我们都像是荒原上待宰的瘤兽，等待特区政府决定我们的未来……","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"我觉得自己像颗掉进洗衣机里的洋葱，在一股又一股狂热的浪潮当中掉了一层又一层的皮。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你是想从洗衣机里逃出来，还是不想再当无能为力的洋葱？","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"唔……","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"几年前第三次闯入骸骨荒原的时候，我想过一件很有趣的事。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"如果我偷偷把一车赤金原矿运进封锁线，再大摇大摆地拉着它从禁区岗哨走出来……","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"哥伦比亚人一定会忘掉所有恐怖传说，立刻开启另一次大拓荒，不会比我们现在经历的一切逊色多少。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"哪怕它的起点只是一个百无聊赖的小导游，而非一个撕开了天幕的科学家；哪怕它只是一个骗局，而非一次壮举。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我们总想从“不可能”的大门内看到一种全新的可能，总想逃出望不到头的常规，去不一样的地方、过不一样的生活。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你、我，“螺旋桨天堂”成百上千的体验员，甚至莱茵那个叫斯凯的助理研究员……大家都一样。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"洋葱没办法逃出洗衣机……","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"但我们可以记住，自己最初是为了什么才跳进去。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"……","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"如果政府今晚没以叛国罪名把我们都处死，我还是想留在“螺旋桨天堂”，接着经营“幸运瘤兽”，把债还上。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"以及，能帮忙给我妻子送封信吗？我不放心一般信使。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"那，要不要加入费尔南旅行团？把你人送过去都成哦。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"charslot","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我不信泰拉大陆有你这样的科学家。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hammerhit","loop":"true","channel":"qd","id":174},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"qd","fadetime":"1.2","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"（铿锵的捶打声）","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你到底是怎么跟古斯塔夫认识的？你清楚他跟梅兰德的计划？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":180},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swrdbrnsh","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":181},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.9","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"（沙沙的抛光声）","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哼，最终还是没能给他一个教训。浮空层坠落之后，老狐狸就跟着梅兰德的人跑了。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"他是被铐走的。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"铐走？哈，想让我成为“螺旋桨天堂”的罪人，最后反而自己成了替罪的！","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ironhitone","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"（清脆的金属声）","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"不错。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你在这儿坐了半天了，又是钳子又是锤子的……研究什么呢？","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"在为赶路做准备。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":198},{"type":"text","text":"高大的库兰塔向高登示意自己的“鞋底”，对方这才意识到，库兰塔走路时发出的声响并非源于鞋具。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"嘶，这半圆形的金属垫……得把铁钉一锤子一锤子敲进去才能固定吧？这样不疼？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"不疼。在复杂的地形上——萨尔贡的沼泽、萨米的雪原、哥伦比亚的荒原……自己的脚比鞋更值得信任。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"看来，你不打算向我隐瞒自己的身份。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"在整个事件中我无足轻重。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"我只是来这里帮个朋友，又交了个朋友。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"……","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"自由得令人生厌。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"以你的阅历，足以跟我同行，但你不会。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"这次事故之后，管理局内部的人员肯定会遭受清洗。老狐狸的势力都没了，我有什么理由不回去？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"再说了，我那个收藏室的东西你全都认识，要是跟你一起游历，不是永远比不过你？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我会好好利用管理局的资源，把零五四改造成连你都说不出道理的样子。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"拭目以待。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4213_skybx_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"喂，科学顾问，你到底还有什么地方没去过？星荚之外？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4213_skybx_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"仍有很多没人走过的路。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科学顾问？","text":"如果有一天人类真能比肩云霄，我依旧会俯瞰大地。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":227},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":231},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_bg_68_g10_treeplatform_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":234},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":235,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我这次看见你来了，梅希亚小姐。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"难得见您没有埋头在工件堆里。您在等人？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你呢？你的同僚在日落之前就已经全部撤出了“螺旋桨天堂”。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"“一定要最后一个走”也是我不知道的某条秘书准则？","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我只是在收拾行李的时候犯了难。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"（萨卡兹语）悬浮。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"all","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","id":254},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_float","loop":"true","channel":"pf","id":255},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":256},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"pf","fadetime":"0.3","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"谢谢……我还在发愁怎么把这么多箱子都拖下去呢。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"然后你选择了拖着它们绕最远的路，从“树”这边走？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……娜斯提主任，我确实想来看看拂哀菈……您的母亲，最后的归宿。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"“树”在此刻承载的新叶，都是拂哀菈的墓志铭。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"走的时候多抬头看看吧。如果她还记得你，或许会让风带一片叶子到你手里。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您不记恨我利用拂哀菈完成了梅兰德的任务？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你也为了帮她而违抗了梅兰德的命令。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"如果你接下来的归宿是监狱，我丝毫不会感到哥伦比亚变得更公平了。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"请您放心。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"锡人前辈曾经还往自己身上装饰过塞勒涅先生扔掉的无人机零件呢。有没有用，不是他评判是非的唯一标准。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我的一次小小的叛逆，也不会成为他评判是非的唯一依据。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"嗯。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"啊，那边……应该是您等的人到了？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"那我就先告辞了，娜斯提主任。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"斯凯，给我参数。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"传输过去了。一切正常，“树”的运行状态非常健康。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"但这些你自己也看得出来吧，主任？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"只是确保你的脑袋没有在那场战斗中受损。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我在特里蒙的棚户区最先学会的就是打架。如果打架那么容易打坏脑袋，我就不会出现在莱茵了，主任。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我回来之前，“树”的常规维护，其他衍生项目，以及我们所有的职员、园区的工人和体验员，都要由你负责。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我需要你的状态足够好。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"项目情况我都了解。但，那些工人和体验员……他们刚刚还问我，你喜欢些什么，想着在你走之前向你道谢。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"他们留在这是因为你，娜斯提主任。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"他们问的时候，你是怎么回答的？","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"呃，我不知道。我确实不知道你喜欢什么……除了我们的事业之外。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"明天，或许试着给老皮特带一张《星荚大战》的邮票吧。他会告诉你每个人的性格和喜好的。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"主任，你……","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我在荒地上最先学会的就是和人打交道。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"那你自己到底喜欢什么？","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不难发现的。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那么，“树”就交给你照管了。我该走了。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"嗯？你等的人呢？","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"他习惯了独自赶路，大概已经走了。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"走了？这可是荒地啊！","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"他总会有办法的。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":329},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"charslot","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":333},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_bg_29_g9_headquarter.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_horsewalk","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":338},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":340},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":341},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":342},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_formal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":343,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2051_1#1$1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱茵研究员","text":"欸，站住，这里是莱茵生命总部，访客先在那边登记。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2051_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱茵研究员","text":"你的脚步声太响了，从你一进来我就注意到你了。这副打扮，你刚从荒野上回来？要想混进莱茵窃取商业机密，好歹也换身行头啊。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2051_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scan","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2051_1#1$1","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱茵研究员","text":"主、主任权限……您是？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2051_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱茵研究员","text":"……抱、抱歉。我这就带您上楼，其他人都在会议室等您。","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2051_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2038_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"谢谢。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2038_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":357},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"background","id":362},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_68_i14_1.png","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":363},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"40","block":"false","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":366},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act25side/m_avg_decisivebattle_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":367,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……其他的部分都在屏幕上了，情况差不多就是这样。","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"“螺旋桨天堂”已经与麦克斯特区完成接驳，接下来的时间，特区政府会着手对整个地块进行检修和资源清点。","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"数百家科技公司、上千个飞天主题的科研项目、两三万人口……这项工作可能会持续数月之久。","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"好在塞雷娅和杰克逊的谈判很成功，所以莱茵工程科在“螺旋桨天堂”只需要做工程科该做的事情。","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"在我返回之前，斯凯·杰格会负责相应的事务。他成长了不少。","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"你居然在培养新人欸。","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"这段时间真是辛苦了，娜斯提。","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"中间也多亏了你帮忙……缪尔赛思，如果你能删掉那几张变成我的样子挤眉弄眼的照片，我会更感谢你。","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我不。","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"对了，你真不打算给我讲讲你母亲的事吗？","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不打算。","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"你身上有了一些变化……很好的那种变化，我说不上来。","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"娜斯提……","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"好吧。我哭过一场，想通了一些事情，坚定了一些事情，就这样。","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"咳咳——我专门离开实验室一趟，不是为了看两位闺蜜情深的。","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"这两年你对科学狂热得有点太过忘我了，斐尔迪南，忘我到我有点想念你之前的钻营，和一门心思让莱茵归于自己掌握的样子。","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"难道现在不是吗？","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"这两年，是我在高能物理学上的新突破支撑着各个科室的新研究，同僚们。","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"嗯，也多亏了你帮忙。","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我看，多萝西是因为不想听你自夸，才不来参会的吧？","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"呵，接受完相关的问询之后，她直接回了359实验基地。她说这段时间自己又做了几个梦……不会向前看的人。","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"塞雷娅，娜斯提已经将“树”的实验结果同步到了我的邮箱，仅仅是“螺旋桨天堂”的事情，不值得我们这些人都聚在这里开会吧？","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"当然。","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"那我们在等谁？","id":392},{"type":"dialog","id":393},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_glassdooropen","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"或许你会有兴趣看看因非冰原的资料？","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"……","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"你终于回来了，马里亚姆。","id":398},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":400},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_68_i14_2.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"装蹄花了点时间，从特区徒步到特里蒙，正好用来磨合。抱歉，我太久没回哥伦比亚了。","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"幸好在“螺旋桨天堂”没等你太久。我安排好了车辆，本可以一起返回莱茵。","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"……这个我倒是没有想过。","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"一个热衷于在大地的各个角落找死的家伙，必然习惯了一个人行动，理解。","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"启动“树”的核心元件，需要起码两位主任级别的莱茵员工权限。我原本还在想，塞雷娅到底安排了谁去帮娜斯提……","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"传说早就暴尸荒野，记者们甚至怀疑莱茵是否存在这号人物的科考科主任，倒是没有比你更为合适的人选了。只是——","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"你想问谁安排的？小贾斯汀。","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"他在察帕特有一些商业投资，我从因非冰原离开的第一时间，他便联系上了我。","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"他让我入境哥伦比亚后直奔特区，之后不久，我便接到了古斯塔夫的邀约电话……显然小贾斯汀做了一番，嗯，运作。","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"那你本来——","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"返回莱茵的目的？我在因非冰原的最深处，无根之花盛开得最灿烂的地方，发现了……那个圆形巨构的碎片。","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"你猜到了？是的。克丽斯腾留下的资料里，提到过那个巨构。她说上个时代的人称之为，“星门”。","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"塞雷娅待会儿应该会向你们同步这些情报。斐尔迪南，还有问题吗？没了吧。","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"……","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"哈哈哈，马里亚姆，你还是习惯自问自答，让斐尔迪南无话可说啊。","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"好了，各位，人差不多到齐了。","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"这场会议来得有些迟了。这两年来，几乎哥伦比亚所有的主流媒体和科技小报都下过类似的论断……","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"“万星园消失的那道缝隙，既是星荚的伤痕，也是莱茵的伤痕。”他们甚至围绕着莱茵取消了年终酒会而编排了一些故事。","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我们都很忙，仅此而已。","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"嗯。现在，我们也忙得差不多了。","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"工程科与生态科的联合项目虽然出了一些意外，但就最后的结果而言，很成功。娜斯提，你现在握着开启一个全新领域的钥匙。","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……前提是我们真的能握紧它。","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"毫无疑问，马里亚姆在因非冰原的发现，证实了克丽斯腾得到的那些远超常理的“怪谈”，确实是基于真实图景的“知识”。","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马里亚姆","text":"或许，我们能借此重建与上个时代的对话。","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"至于我们在谢拉格的观测站，缪尔赛思带回来了一些资料……","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"非常有意思的资料哦……或者说，非常危险。","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"玻利瓦尔的事情你们应该已经有所耳闻，哥伦比亚的二十多支科考队消失在了黑流树海。","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"如果是那片神秘沼泽有了什么异变，探险家和阴谋家们又该兴奋起来了。塞雷娅，莱茵应该有所行动。","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"麦哲伦已经动身了。","id":430},{"type":"dialog","id":431},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"自克丽斯腾的事件后，有越来越多的事件和现象在告诉我们，这片大地上埋藏最深的那些谜题，都拥有同一种答案。","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"那答案将会告诉我们，泰拉因何而存在，未来等待着我们的，究竟是灾难还是新的“世界”。","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"莱茵生命已经完成新一轮的科研布局，但这还不够，我们需要回应科学对未知的一切恐慌，到达所有的未知之境……","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"娜斯提，你刚才的话没错……","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"但莱茵生命，需要成为转动那把钥匙的人。","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐尔迪南","text":"（低声）哇哦……","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塞雷娅","text":"当然，在那之前，我会补上欠大家的酒会。","id":439},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":440},{"type":"dialog","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"charslot","id":443},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":444},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_68_i14_3.png","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":445},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"60","block":"false","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":448},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$act19side_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act19side/m_sys_act19side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":449,"musicid":4},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"小贾斯汀，这是？","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"报纸的样刊，在正式付梓前，想请您为这则新闻取个标题，这帮科学家们凑在一起，究竟是在“哀悼一场‘天空热’的陨落”……","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"还是在“酝酿新的变局”？","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你将自己和同事们的通讯截图送给了《拯救者报》？","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"应该说，是国防部口径的报社拿到了一份本不可能有公开途径获取的资料。","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"小贾斯汀，可我听说你们的总辖已经和杰克逊那家伙就“螺旋桨天堂”的事情达成了一致。","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"不合您心意对吗？但这并不耽误我和您再另做一桩买卖。","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你应该清楚，“地平弧光计划”之后，莱茵生命在国防部的信誉已经成了约翰老妈套餐的刮刮乐大奖——约等于无。","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"所以我才在塞雷娅与杰克逊达成一致后，再来找您。","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"连续经历了在玻利瓦尔的失势、“地平弧光计划”的失败，还有“螺旋桨天堂”的事故之后，国防部在马克·麦克斯总统那边的信誉……","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"我就不去引用那些刻薄的谚语了，先生。","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"我不清楚家里的那帮科学家具体在鼓捣些什么，但我清楚他们会创造出的价值。这一点，想必您也不会质疑。","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"我是个商人，我得为莱茵争取尽可能多的利益。","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"听起来，我没有拒绝的理由。","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"荣幸之至。","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"小贾斯汀，说实话，布莱克引荐你的时候，我多少是有点瞧不上你这样的家伙的……","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"哈哈哈，先生，还记得吗？我刚刚向您分享了我那还算有趣的人生经历……","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"您只需要瞧得上命运。至于您对握住它脉搏的那个人持何种态度——","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小贾斯汀","text":"往往不由您做主。","id":470},{"type":"dialog","id":471},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":472},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":473},{"type":"bgeffect","id":474},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":475},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":476},{"type":"image","id":477},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":478}],"characters":["塞雷娅","杰克逊","费尔南","雅斯彭","高登","科学顾问？","娜斯提","梅希亚","斯凯","莱茵研究员","？？？","缪尔赛思","斐尔迪南","马里亚姆","小贾斯汀"]}